Fixed. The bug was the `break;` on line 14 of `src/url_utils.ts:14` — it exited the loop after deleting the first matching tracking param, so any subsequent ones (`fbclid` after `utm_source`, etc.) remained in the saved URL.

What changed:
- Removed the `break;` so the loop continues and strips every `TRACKING_PARAMS` entry present in the URL.

Verified:
- `deno test` passes (3 passed, 0 failed).
- No existing tests covered `normalizeUrl`, so I didn't add a fixture — the fix is a one-line removal of the premature loop exit.


